<h1><a class="title-link" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YSi78g2CXCM&list=RDYSi78g2CXCM&start_radio=1">Music is Math</a></h1>

<p class="lede">
  Theory Aide is a free and open-source project for understanding what your
  music is doing. The goal is to provide a tool that helps people better
  express creativity while also understanding the theory, or "rules," that
  underlie it.
</p>

<p>
  Music theory isn't hard. It's just kinda weird. It's not intuitive because,
  in a very real way, it's just made-up rules. That undersells the fact that
  modern theory is heavily steeped in math, and the rules we decided upon
  rely on ideas that go back to ancient Greece. You don't have to speak the
  language, but it sure does help. As such, I want to do what I can to make
  this stuff as accessible as possible.
</p>

<p>This is that project.</p>

